&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HZRgdVz7SodlIgxe1CnlWJgjgNe&quot;&gt;You will join our global Web3 Growth Team and support the &lt;strong&gt;global growth and ecosystem development of RWA-related and broader Web3 initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
